; The whole-circle input arc starts at 0 instead of 0.2 radians.
; Its returned Circle and depth are unchanged (boundary.hpp step 1).

; Start and end equal make a full turn in the Tecnigrafo Arc bridge.
A = ARC center=0,0 radius=10 start-angle=0 end-angle=0
? hatch-boundary 0,0 units=6 -> enclosed loop=external+derived+edges circle=0,0;10
? hatch-boundary 10,0 units=6 -> on-curve A
? hatch-contours A -> left-out=A
